  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KLD Market Expansion Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Livestock Beneficiaries: 515 (305 women) Description: This is an expansion grant to increase the volume of sales through the Bermo herder-managed livestock market, as well as to promote improved cheese production by members to make use of excess milk. The project will result in increased incomes to members and establish KLD as a model for herder-managed livestock marketing in the subregion.</narrative>
  </description>
